Description: Forward iOS notifications to Bark, Gotify, email, webhooks and your own JavaScript.
 Pusher reads every notification that reaches Notification Center and forwards
 it to the destinations you choose. Each destination keeps its own app filter,
 device conditions and log, so a work chat and a personal reminder need not go
 to the same place.
 .
 FEATURES
 . * Any number of destinations per service - several Bark servers, several
   webhooks, several mailboxes, each with its own settings and history.
 . * Per-destination JavaScript: define a service once, and every instance reads
   its own parameter values. Scripts get fetch, localStorage and a timeout.
 . * Notification filter: block or redirect notifications by app and keyword,
   with several rule groups, AND / OR matching and regular expressions.
 . * A script editor with syntax highlighting, line numbers, a formatter and an
   example library.
 . * Per-app overrides, device and sound lists, notification settings
   conditions, and a log of what was forwarded, what was not, and why.
 . * Import and export destinations as a file, so a second device is one tap.
 . * English and Chinese interface.
 .
 SERVICES
 . Bark, DingTalk, Email (SMTP), Feishu, Gotify, IFTTT, Pushbullet, Pusher
 Receiver, Pushover, ServerChan 3, ServerChan Turbo, WeCom bot, WeCom webhook,
 WxPusher, Shortcuts, a generic webhook, and a service you write yourself.
 .
 COMPATIBILITY
 . iOS 15 - 16. roothide and rootless builds are published separately; install
 the one your jailbreak provides. The app picker needs AltList.
 .
 NOTE
 . This is a beta. Settings from 2.x are not migrated, a few things may still
 change, and the example Shortcut's signature expires in November 2027.
 .
 ----
 .
 把通知从 iOS 转发到任何你已经在用的服务：Bark、Gotify、钉钉、企业微信、飞书、
 邮件、Webhook，或者你自己写的 JavaScript。
 .
 Pusher 读取每一条进入通知中心的通知，转发到你指定的目标。每个目标可以有独立的
 App 过滤、设备条件和日志，所以工作群和个人提醒不必挤在同一个去处。
 .
 功能
 . * 同一个服务可以添加任意多个目标：多个 Bark 服务器、多个 Webhook、多个邮箱，
   各自保存自己的配置与日志。
 . * 每个目标独立运行 JavaScript：服务类型写一次，实例各自读取自己的参数值。
   脚本可以使用 fetch、localStorage 和每次运行的超时限制。
 . * 通知过滤：按 App 和关键字拦截或改道通知，支持多个规则组、全部 / 任一匹配
   和正则表达式。
 . * 脚本编辑器带语法高亮、行号、格式化和示例库。
 . * 单 App 覆盖、设备与声音列表、通知设置条件，以及完整的转发日志：哪些转发了、
   哪些没有、为什么。
 . * 导入导出目标配置，第二台设备一次恢复。
 . * 中英双语界面。
 .
 内置服务
 . Bark、钉钉、邮件（SMTP）、飞书、Gotify、IFTTT、Pushbullet、Pusher Receiver、
 Pushover、Server酱³、Server酱·Turbo版、企业微信·机器人、企业微信·消息推送、
 WxPusher、快捷指令、自定义 Webhook，以及你自己写的 JavaScript 服务。
 .
 兼容性
 . 支持 iOS 15 - 16。roothide 与 rootless 分别发布，安装与你越狱方式对应的版本。
 App 选择器需要 AltList。
